    "&lt;p&gt;The development by reason of the inadequate supporting Flood Risk Assessment information, fails to mitigate the compensatory flood storage required to overcome the surface water flood risk and demonstrate the proposed development would not exacerbate the risk of flooding within the site or increase the risk and consequences of flooding elsewhere. As such, the development is contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), policies SI12 and SI13 of The London Plan (2021) and policies DM9 and DM10 of the Harrow Development Management Polices Local Plan (2013).&lt;/p&gt;"
